---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Disclaimer — Typpy';
const description = 'Read the Typpy disclaimer for service limitations, liability terms, and third-party content notices.';
const url = 'https://typpy.online/disclaimer';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} url={url}>
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-section px-6 md:px-12 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-4xl w-full mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-xl">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-brand-red mb-2">Disclaimer</h1>
        <div class="text-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-2">Last Updated: May 4, 2026</div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-xl text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-md mt-xl">1. Accuracy of Performance Data</h2>
          <p>
            The typing metrics provided by Typpy.online, including but not limited to Words Per Minute
            (WPM), accuracy percentages, and fluency scores, are for informational and entertainment
            purposes only. While we strive for precision in our tracking algorithms, results may vary
            based on hardware latency, browser performance, and internet connection stability.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-md mt-xl">2. No Professional Guarantee</h2>
          <p>
            Typpy.online is designed as a tool for practice and self-improvement. We do not guarantee
            specific professional outcomes, employment results, or the attainment of specific skill
            levels through the use of this platform.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-md mt-xl">3. Service Availability and "As-Is" Basis</h2>
          <p>
            The platform and all its features are provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. We
            do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or
            other harmful components. We reserve the right to modify, update, or discontinue any
            feature (such as specific word count modes or game mechanics) at any time without prior
            notice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-md mt-xl">4. Third-Party Links and Content</h2>
          <p>
            The platform may contain links to third-party websites or content. Typpy.online does not
            endorse, guarantee, or assume responsibility for the accuracy or reliability of any
            information offered by third-party websites linked through the platform.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-md mt-xl">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by law, Typpy.online and its operators shall not be liable
            for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from your use of,
            or inability to use, the platform.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
